<title>USA: USDA offers East Africa $35 mln under GSM-102.</title>
<headline>USDA offers East Africa $35 mln under GSM-102.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said Wednesday it was offering Kenya and Uganda $35 million in credit guarantees for sales of U.S. farm commodities under the GSM-102 program for fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>Commodities covered include breeder livestock, feed grains, meat, rice, vegetable oils and wheat.</p>
<p>-- Washington Commodities Desk (202) 898-8394</p>
</text>
